  "traits": "Recommended Ability Score Increase: +2 Wis or Cha, +1 Int\nSpeed: 30 feet.\nSkill Proficiencies: Illusions, Insight\nIllusory Genius: You reduce downtime cost to learn Genjutsu you qualify for by an amount equal to their rank, to a minimum of 1. (D-Rank: 1, C-Rank: 2, B-Rank: 3, A-Rank: 4, S-Rank: 5)\nDeep Sleep: Over the course of a long rest, your dreams are made manifest. Select one skill or Toolkit and gain proficiency in it until your next long rest. If you have proficiency already, you instead gain a rank of Mastery with that skill\nPhotographic Memory: You retain information, images and words better than anyone. Your mind is a lockbox. You can perfectly recall anything you’ve read, seen or heard within the last 3 months, without making a check.",
